      "Week 1: the pendulum, wand elevation and rotation in the pain-free range, and isometric external rotation and abduction.",
      "Week 2: active movement including internal rotation and abduction, front and back capsule stretches, and scapular setting.",
      "Week 3: bands and light weights (band and side-lying external rotation, and the row).",
      "Weeks 4 and 5: progressive strength and overhead and functional tasks (lifting objects to a high shelf).",
      "Keep exercising if a later flare comes, and report severe pain.",
